# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Key material. Never commit any of this.
#
# The Ed25519 private key is the identity. There is no recovery path and no
# rotation story: lose it and the DID is gone, leak it and someone else is you.
# These patterns are the belt; the suspenders are that the key lives outside
# this tree entirely (see README, "Where the key lives").
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.pkcs8
*.der
agent.ed25519*
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*

# Rotation leftovers. `keygen --force` parks the previous key at
# agent.ed25519.pem.bak.<YYYYmmdd-HHMMSS> before writing the new one, and that
# file is a live private key with a name that no longer ends in .pem.
*.bak.*
*.bak
*.old
*.orig

# Nonce ledger. Not secret, but it is per-machine mutable state: committing it
# and then pulling on another machine rewinds the counter, and a replayed nonce
# is a rejected post at best.
nonces.json
room_nonces.json

# The whole agent home, in case anyone ever symlinks or copies it in here.
.technocore/
technocore-home/

# Generic secret-shaped things.
*.env
.env*
secrets.*
*credentials*
*.token

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal operations tooling. Not part of the published artifact.
#
# The airdrop monitor and its state are local to one machine: the hook config
# carries an absolute path, and log/ is the private record CLAUDE.md section 4
# asks for. state/room-owners-audit.json is deliberately NOT ignored -- that
# one is evidence and belongs in the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
watch/
state/watch-*.json
log/
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Private operating documents. HANDOFF.md carries the plan and the hardware
# assessment; OUTREACH.md carries draft form answers with personal-information
# fields in them. Neither is part of the published artifact.
HANDOFF.md
OUTREACH.md
ZENN-DRAFT.md
TODO.md
STATUS.md
